<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia DCB 1996 net up 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia DCB 1996 net up 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec. 31, 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		349.00	  vs	 279.22</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	44.6	   vs	  35.8</p>
<p>    Pretax profit	  564.38	   vs	 470.92</p>
<p>    Minorities		22.42	   vs	  32.76</p>
<p>    Operating profit   2,273.26	   vs	1,687.50</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)    10.0	    vs	   10.0</p>
<p>NOTE: DCB Holdings Bhd is a banking and financial services concern.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
